# Symfony AI Mate — a development-only tool, see the README. Everything below is
# generated by `mate init` and is machine- or editor-specific: the MCP command
# depends on how you run PHP, and the agent files depend on which agent you use.
# Nothing here belongs to the project, so none of it is committed; only the
# Composer requirement is, and that is dev-only.
/mate/
/mcp.json
/.mcp.json
/AGENTS.md
/.agents/
/bin/codex
